	d\, wannabe rock star who decides to earn a few extra bucks by posing as a
	 substitute teacher at a prestigious prep school. There he turns a class o
	f straight-A students into a guitar-shredding\, bass-slapping\, mind-blowi
	ng rock band – sensationally performed live by the production’s young acto
	rs every night with roof-raising energy!\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org
